### 1. Login first to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

### 2. Global Search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/search/global?q=authentication
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 3. Advanced Task Search
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/search/tasks?q=api&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 4. Search with Filters
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/workspaces/YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID/search/tasks?assigneeId=USER_ID&dueDateFrom=2024-01-01&dueDateTo=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN